 "table_id": null, "row_id": null, "quality_warnings": [], "source_locations": [{"file_id": "D05-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D05_办公网络接入指南_原生.pdf", "sha256": "468dcdffde9e628d40f6b7a32db4b483af08f657c4a450b05524e31b616e15cf", "method": "pdf_text", "page": 2, "bbox": [48.0, 426.6171875, 191.75, 438.1171875], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}, {"file_id": "D05-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D05_办公网络接入指南_原生.pdf", "sha256": "468dcdffde9e628d40f6b7a32db4b483af08f657c4a450b05524e31b616e15cf", "method": "pdf_text", "page": 2, "bbox": [48.0, 453.4765625, 546.75, 481.4765625], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}, {"file_id": "D05-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D05_办公网络接入指南_原生.pdf", "sha256": "468dcdffde9e628d40f6b7a32db4b483af08f657c4a450b05524e31b616e15cf", "method": "pdf_text", "page": 2, "bbox": [48.0, 497.4765625, 546.75, 525.4765625], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}], "snippet": "第七节 确认网络与业务访问\n\nVPN显示已连接但目标系统无法打开时，应记录目标系统名称、错误提示和发生时间。可以区分为网页无法访问、页面能够打开但登录失败、登录后缺少某项业务功能等不同现象，便于确认网络和业务权限问题。\n\n不应把“没有导出权限”等业务角色限制理解为VPN故障。例如某产品功能仅管理员可用时，网络连通并不能替代角色授权。相关产品权限应查阅对应产品", "rrf_score": 0.031498, "bm25_score": 6.003809, "vector_score": 0.607718}, {"doc_id": "D05", "version_date": "2026-01-01", "chunk_id": "c005", "title": "办公网络接入指南", "topic": "VPN", "scope": "全体员工", "status": "有效", "parent_id": "r005", "related_ids": [], "heading_path": ["办公网络接入指南", "第五节 建立连接"], "token_count": 208, "kind": "text", "table_id": null, "row_id": null, "quality_warnings": [], "source_locations": [{"file_id": "D05-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D05_办公网络接入指南_原生.pdf", "sha256": "468dcdffde9e628d40f6b7a32db4b483af08f657c4a450b05524e31b616e15cf", "method": "pdf_text", "page": 2, "bbox": [48.0, 184.6171875, 134.25, 196.1171875], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}, {"file_id": "D05-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D05_办公网络接入指南_原生.pdf", "sha256": "468dcdffde9e628d40f6b7a32db4b483af08f657c4a450b05524e31b616e15cf", "method": "pdf_text", "page": 2, "bbox": [48.0, 211.4765625, 546.75, 239.4765625], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}, {"file_id": "D05-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D05_办公网络接入指南_原生.pdf", "sha256": "468dcdffde9e628d40f6b7a32db4b483af08f657c4a450b05524e31b616e15cf", "method": "pdf_text", "page": 2, "bbox": [48.0, 255.4765625, 541.5, 283.4765625], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}], "snippet": "第五节 建立连接\n\n审批通过后使用企业账号和动态验证码登录。启动企业确认的VPN客户端，核对接入配置，输入本人企业账号，并按照界面要求完成动态验证。验证码应在有效期内使用，不应复制给他人代为登录。\n\n连接过程中应观察界面提示，区分正在连接、验证失败、连接超时和已连接。客户端显示已连接后，再尝试访问获准使用的内部系统。不要因登录过程耗时而连续重复提交，以免混淆", "rrf_score": 0.029469, "bm25_score": 2.733797, "vector_score": 0.582895}, {"doc_id": "D05", "version_date": "2026-01-01", "chunk_id": "c013", "title": "办公网络接入指南", "topic": "VPN", "scope": "全体员工", "status": "有效", "parent_id": "r013", "related_ids": [], "heading_path": ["办公网络接入指南", "第十三节 工单填写模板"], "token_count": 241, "kind": "text", "table_id": null, "row_id": null, "quality_warnings": [], "source_locations": [{"file_id": "D05-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D05_办公网络接入指南_原生.pdf", "sha256": "468dcdffde9e628d40f6b7a32db4b483af08f657c4a450b05524e31b616e15cf", "method": "pdf_text", "page": 4, "bbox": [48.0, 184.6171875, 168.75, 196.1171875], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}, {"file_id": "D05-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D05_办公网络接入指南_原生.pdf", "sha256": "468dcdffde9e628d40f6b7a32db4b483af08f657c4a450b05524e31b616e15cf", "method": "pdf_text", "page": 4, "bbox": [48.0, 211.4765625, 546.75, 256.9765625], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}, {"file_id": "D05-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D05_办公网络接入指南_原生.pdf", "sha256": "468dcdffde9e628d40f6b7a32db4b483af08f657c4a450b05524e31b616e15cf", "method": "pdf_text", "page": 4, "bbox": [48.0, 272.9765625, 541.5, 318.4765625], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}], "snippet": "第十三节 工单填写模板\n\n问题摘要应写明“在哪一步、出现什么现象、影响哪个系统”。例如“已显示连接成功，但内部知识系统页面超时”比“VPN坏了”更便于处理。再填写发生时间、客户端提示、网络类型、影响范围和已尝试步骤。示例不包含真实系统地址。\n\n工单不应把未经确认的猜测写成结论。可以写“怀疑与网络切换有关，尚未确认”，但不要写成“服务端已经故障”。若其他同事遇", "rrf_score": 0.029274, "bm25_score": 5.283072, "vector_score": 0.542369}, {"doc_id": "D05", "version_date": "2026-01-01", "chunk_id": "c001", "title": "办公网络接入指南", "topic": "VPN", "scope": "全体员工", "status": "有效", "parent_id": "r001", "related_ids": [], "heading_path": ["办公网络接入指南", "第一节 企业VPN的使用范围"], "token_count": 233, "kind": "text", "table_id": null, "row_id": null, "quality_warnings": [], "source_locations": [{"file_id": "D05-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D05_办公网络接入指南_原生.pdf", "sha256": "468dcdffde9e628d40f6b7a32db4b483af08f657c4a450b05524e31b616e15cf", "method": "pdf_text", "page": 1, "bbox": [48.0, 184.6171875, 186.0, 196.1171875], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}, {"file_id": "D05-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D05_办公网络接入指南_原生.pdf", "sha256": "468dcdffde9e628d40f6b7a32db4b483af08f657c4a450b05524e31b616e15cf", "method": "pdf_text", "page": 1, "bbox": [48.0, 211.4765625, 541.5, 256.9765625], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}, {"file_id": "D05-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D05_办公网络接入指南_原生.pdf", "sha256": "468dcdffde9e628d40f6b7a32db4b483af08f657c4a450b05524e31b616e15cf", "method": "pdf_text", "page": 1, "bbox": [48.0, 272.9765625, 541.5, 300.9765625], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}], "snippet": "第一节 企业VPN的使用范围\n\n员工在公司外访问内部系统时，需要使用企业VPN。企业VPN用于建立访问内部资源所需的网络连接；连接成功不代表自动获得每个系统的业务权限。用户仍需满足目标系统的账号、角色与授权要求。本文仅适用于企业员工的接入流程。\n\n本指南不规定个人设备准入、海外网络接入、承包商访问或其他远程访问产品的使用办法。若使用环境属于上述情况，应补充相", "rrf_score": 0.029211, "bm25_score": 4.719493, "vector_score": 0.559932}]}}
